<title>USA: J.B. Hunt to buy back up to 2 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>J.B. Hunt to buy back up to 2 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>LOWELL, Ark. 1996-10-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>J.B. Hunt Transport Services Inc said on Thursday its board of directors had decided to buy back up to two million shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement, &quot;... the board also recognizes that an efficient use of its capital may be the repurchase of its common stock at prices that are attractive given the long-term outlook of the company.</p>
<p>&quot;Consequently, the board of directors has authorized the repurchase of up to two million shares of common stock.&quot;</p>
<p>The company has about 38.1 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk, (212) 859-1610</p>
